  "text": {
    "orientation": "Sea surface temperature around Mauritius. One reading every 10 days, from 2023-01-23 to 2023-08-01. It goes from 27.12 to 24.77 °C. No data for 2023-02-02.",
    "alt_short": "Sea temperature map around Mauritius: 27.12 to 24.77 °C.",
    "alt_long": "A map of the sea around Mauritius, coloured by temperature, for 19 dates between 2023-01-23 and 2023-08-01. Warm water is shown in warm colours. The area-wide reading is 27.12 °C on 2023-01-23 and 24.77 °C on 2023-08-01. Land has no sea temperature and is left blank.",
    "legend": "Higher pitch means warmer water. Silence means no map was published for that date. Each reading is the average of the sea points in the area."
  }
